## Run it

```sh
uv run $script serve --port $port
uv run pytest agents/$name
```

## Where to read

`src/$package/agent.py` is the agent. The classes are declared in
`src/$package/schema/$name.yaml`; after editing it, run
`uv run dd-gen-schema agents/$name/src/$package/schema/$name.yaml` and keep `classes.py` in step.
